{"team":"ATL","col":"#FF525B","identity":"run-heavy","funnel":"run-funnel","plays_pg":62.0,"adot":7.9,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>Built to Run</h2><p>Few offenses are as committed to the run as ATL. Their pass rate over expected sits at <strong>-7%</strong> \u2014 well below the -2% norm \u2014 and it collapses to 33% once they're in front. The script writes itself: build a lead, then bludgeon.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>Their run game attacks the perimeter \u2014 <strong>32% of carries hit the edge</strong> (league ~25%), an outside-zone lean that rewards speed backs and can boom for chunk gains.</p><p>They live in the shotgun (81% of snaps vs ~68%) \u2014 a spread, pass-oriented structure.</p><p><strong>Kyle Pitts</strong> is a genuine centerpiece, not an afterthought \u2014 <strong>18%</strong> of targets (league ~15%).</p><p>By the numbers it's an efficient unit \u2014 a 46% success rate (above the 44% average).</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>run-first</strong> (46% pass), funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>Bijan Robinson</strong>. And with the TE commanding 18% of targets, <strong>Kyle Pitts</strong> is a live red-zone option too.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 Soft on the Ground</h2><p>They surrender <strong>124 rushing</strong> and <strong>229 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). The run moves against them \u2014 <strong>target opposing RB1s</strong>.</p><p>They lock down opposing WR1s \u2014 just 52 rec yds/game (vs ~58); fade receiving props there.</p><p>They leak <strong>WR1 receiving TDs</strong> (0.47/game vs ~0.38) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: back <strong>Bijan Robinson</strong>'s rushing volume in favored/positive scripts; <strong>opposing RB1s</strong> smash on the ground and at the goal line.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Tua Tagovailoa","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":6,"props":{"Comp":18.64,"Att":27.43,"Pass Yds":207.82,"Pass TD":1.39,"INT":1.62,"Rush Yds":3.97}}],"RB":[{"name":"Bijan Robinson","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":44,"props":{"Rush Att":15.64,"Rush Yds":74.87,"Tgt":6.01,"Rec":4.63,"Rec Yds":39.51}},{"name":"Brian Robinson","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":17,"props":{"Rush Att":3.13,"Rush Yds":12.73,"Tgt":1.57,"Rec":1.1,"Rec Yds":8.12}},{"name":"Tyler Goodson","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":11,"props":{"Rush Att":2.2,"Rush Yds":10.48,"Tgt":1.29,"Rec":0.84,"Rec Yds":5.35}}],"WR":[{"name":"Drake London","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":26,"props":{"Tgt":7.66,"Rec":4.84,"Rec Yds":62.5,"Rec TD":0.3}},{"name":"Jahan Dotson","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":15,"props":{"Tgt":3.36,"Rec":1.69,"Rec Yds":20.8,"Rec TD":0.17}},{"name":"Olamide Zaccheaus","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":14,"props":{"Tgt":3.41,"Rec":2.17,"Rec Yds":24.69,"Rec TD":0.15}},{"name":"Zachariah Branch","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":11,"props":{"Tgt":2.56,"Rec":1.41,"Rec Yds":18.01,"Rec TD":0.11}},{"name":"Chris Blair","slot":"WR5","starter":false,"td":9,"props":{"Tgt":2.05,"Rec":1.12,"Rec Yds":13.96,"Rec TD":0.09}}],"TE":[{"name":"Kyle Pitts","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":20,"props":{"Tgt":7.46,"Rec":4.76,"Rec Yds":58.82,"Rec TD":0.23}},{"name":"Charlie Woerner","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":8,"props":{"Tgt":2.46,"Rec":1.51,"Rec Yds":13.16,"Rec TD":0.08}},{"name":"Austin Hooper","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":9,"props":{"Tgt":2.68,"Rec":1.63,"Rec Yds":16.76,"Rec TD":0.1}}]},"schedule":[{"week":1,"ha":"@","opp":"PIT","opp_col":"#FFD84D","gid":"2026_01_ATL_PIT","spread":"+3.0","proj":"20\u201323","win":false},{"week":2,"ha":"vs","opp":"CAR","opp_col":"#3AC7F0","gid":"2026_02_CAR_ATL","spread":"\u22121.5","proj":"22\u201321","win":true},{"week":3,"ha":"@","opp":"GB","opp_col":"#FFD84D","gid":"2026_03_ATL_GB","spread":"+7.5","proj":"20\u201327","win":fa